Long time player, First time Poster :)

Even though this is my 9th ascension (5th Val), I hadn't played in a
while, and my last ascension was 1.5 years ago.  Had forgotten the
thrill of standing on Dlvl 1 and heading to the planes :) and wanted to
tell my Val's story.

Val5 a lawful human Valkyrie started out like i play all my lawful
Vals; that is, get Excalibur ASAP.  After that, she ventured into the
mines, cleaned them out with 1 bones file with BoH, magic marker and
misc.  Found lots of /oC early, which allowed her to wipe a cursed -1
CoMR.  BoH in sokoban (boo).  "Big" Bones file netting GoD + misc.  A
little later (Dlvl 14?) found an alter, converted it, and got Mojo.
Found the Fort and quest, but let it go for later.  After finding
Medusas level, went back up, did quest, found BoL, bought divine
protection, cleared the Fort (which got her RDSM).  Ran into a MMF and
decided it was time to genocide h, and while at it, wrote and genocided
L.  Headed through medusa (with BoL) and the castle.  Got SDSM from a
SD in the castle, /oW(0:2).  Wished for BoS, then (I almost forgot)
?oC.  Im glad i remembered cause i didnt find 1 the entire game.
Wished for another MM to enchant armor/weapon.  At this point she was
kitted pretty well, and headed into Gehennom.  Asmodeus and Baalzebub
took (pitiful :))bribes.  Everything else went according to plan (Vlad,
other &, finding the VS).  Then i realized i made a minor mistake.  I
forgot to buy candles, so i had to burn a wish on them.  I did a little
polymorphing to get a =oC, =oL, and another "oLS.  Then up to visit
Rodney with my little friend (a /oD).  Did the ritual, popped on the
=oC and went into the sanctum.  Ran into Rodney again, but the /oD did
another good job on him, as well as the high priest for the "oY.  The
way up was fairly painless.  Only lost 10 Dlvls with the mysterious
force and only a couple were not TC-able.  Rodney made his appearences,
but the /oD made short work of him.  Went on to the planes, Earth was
no problem with /oDigging and =oC. Air gave her some poroblems (Mojo is
much less effective) but health dropped below half only once.  Fire and
water were both benign.  The orb really helps with finding portals :)
Wound up on the right side of the Astral plane, so she went right.  Ran
into and killed Pestilence, ran to the altar and found it was Neutral.
So i ran back out, fought Pestilence again, and went up the center.
This was Death's part, but he went down really quick. This altar was
lawful, so it was time to end it all! :)

